    {
      "source": "Factory method to create a new <a href=\"ApplicationContextAssertProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.test.context.assertj\"><code>ApplicationContextAssertProvider</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "工厂方法，用于创建新的<a href=\"ApplicationContextAssertProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.test.context.assertj\"><code>ApplicationContextAssertProvider</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>type</code> - the type of <a href=\"ApplicationContextAssertProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.test.context.assertj\"><code>ApplicationContextAssertProvider</code></a> required (must be\nan interface)",
      "translation": "<code>type</code>` - 所需的 <a href=\"ApplicationContextAssertProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.test.context.assertj\"><code>ApplicationContextAssertProvider</code></a> 类型（必须是接口）",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>contextType</code> - the type of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> being managed (must be an\ninterface)",
      "translation": "<code>contextType</code> - 被管理的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> 的类型（必须是接口）",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>contextSupplier</code> - a supplier that will either return a fully configured\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> or throw an exception if the context fails to start.",
      "translation": "<code>contextSupplier</code> - 一个供应者，它将返回一个完全配置的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>，或者在上下文启动失败时抛出异常。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - if the source context failed to start",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - 如果源上下文启动失败",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "the source application context",
      "translation": "源应用程序上下文",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "If the original <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> is needed for any reason the\n<a href=\"#getSourceApplicationContext()\"><code>getSourceApplicationContext()</code></a> method can be used.",
      "translation": "如果出于任何原因需要原始的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>，可以使用<a href=\"#getSourceApplicationContext()\"><code>getSourceApplicationContext()</code></a> 方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Any <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> method called on a context that has failed to start will\nthrow an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a>.",
      "translation": "任何在启动失败的上下文中调用的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> 方法都会抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Assertions can be applied using the standard AssertJ <code>assertThat(...)</code> style (see\n<a href=\"ApplicationContextAssert.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.test.context.assertj\"><code>ApplicationContextAssert</code></a> for a complete list). For example:",
      "translation": "断言可以使用标准的 AssertJ <code>assertThat(...)</code>` 风格应用（有关完整列表，请参阅 <a href=\"ApplicationContextAssert.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.test.context.assertj\"><code>ApplicationContextAssert</code></a>）。例如：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the original source <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回原始源 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the original source <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>, casting it to the requested\ntype.",
      "translation": "返回原始源 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>，将其转换为请求的类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the failure that caused application context to fail or <code>null</code> if the\ncontext started without issue.",
      "translation": "返回导致应用程序上下文失败的失败信息，或者如果上下文启动没有问题则返回 <code>null</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "to prevent accidental use.",
      "translation": "为防止误用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return an assert for AspectJ.",
      "translation": "为 AspectJ 返回一个断言。",
      "count": 2
    },
